  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="dek">How Daily Insight Desk handles information when you visit.</p>
  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>At DailyInsightDesk.com, operated by Etern Digital, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and disclose information when you visit our website.</p>
  <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We collect information to operate our website as an informational affiliate publication.</p>
  <h3>Voluntarily provided information</h3>
  <p>You may provide personal information, such as your name or email address, if you choose to contact us. The site does not currently run an email list. If a newsletter opens later, joining it will be optional.</p>
  <h3>Automatically collected information</h3>
  <p>When you visit, we automatically collect certain information about your device, including IP address, browser type, device type, referral URLs, and pages visited, through log files and tracking technologies.</p>
  <h2>3. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
  <p>We use cookies, small data files stored on your device, to understand how visitors use the site and to support affiliate attribution. You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Doing so may limit some features. See the <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>4. Google Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use Google Analytics to analyze website traffic. This service uses cookies to collect information about your use of the site. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>
  <h2>5. Advertising</h2>
  <p>If the site displays advertisements from a third-party network, that network may use cookies to serve ads based on visits to this site and other sites. You can review personalized-ad controls in your Google account at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. The site’s current pages are a publication, not an ad-slot layout.</p>
  <h2>6. Affiliate Links</h2>
  <p>This site participates in affiliate marketing programs. Tracking cookies may identify if you clicked a link on our site and made a purchase on a third-party retailer’s website. That can allow us to earn a commission. Affiliate partners use their own tracking to attribute the referral.</p>
  <h2>7. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To operate and maintain the website.</li>
    <li>To understand which guides are useful and improve them.</li>
    <li>To attribute affiliate commissions.</li>
    <li>To respond to your inquiries.</li>
    <li>To monitor for security problems and abuse.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>8. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
  <p>We process data based on your consent, our legitimate interests in operating the website, and our legal obligations.</p>
  <h2>9. Data Retention and Security</h2>
  <p>We retain information only as long as needed for the purposes in this policy. We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect it from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.</p>
  <h2>10. International Data Transfers</h2>
  <p>We operate from Brazil. Your information may be processed in countries other than your own. By using the site, you consent to that transfer.</p>
  <h2>11. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, including under the GDPR or the CCPA, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete personal information, to object to or restrict processing, and to withdraw consent. To ask, email the address below.</p>
  <h2>12. Children’s Privacy</h2>
  <p>DailyInsightDesk.com does not knowingly collect information from children under 13. If we learn that a child has provided personal information, we will delete it.</p>
  <h2>13. Third-Party Websites</h2>
  <p>Our pages link to retailers and other sites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices. Read their policies before you buy or create an account.</p>
  <h2>14. Changes to this Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the updated policy.</p>
